	{
		"name": "open_lix",
		"title": "LixRay: Open a Lix",
		"description": "LixRay starting point when the user supplied an exact @handle/slug or Lix UUID: resolve it directly without calling list_lixes first, and mint the signed context required by later tools. If branch_id is omitted, pin the context to the Lix's current active branch. The response reports counts plus a bounded file_paths manifest; when file_paths_complete is true, do not run a separate file-list query.",
